4
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,500
あらあら〜、めらめら〜
Ara-ara~ Mela-mela~

5
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,600
あちち〜、めらー！
Achichi~ Mela!

6
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,100
ホロライブ アソビ★まわり隊！
From Hololive's Asobi Mawaritai!

7
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:59,900
ご利益担当の火消し屋サラマンダー
The Fire-Fighting Salamander in charge of blessings...

8
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:03,200
あちち〜めらこと、熱千めら〜！
Achichi Mela, also known as Mela Atsuchi!

9
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,000
のじゃ〜
Noja~

10
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,900
お面を…
Putting on my mask...

11
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:14,600
お面を付けるの…
Putting on my mask...

12
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,400
ど忘れしてた！
I completely forgot!

13
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:22,200
ど忘れしてたのじゃ〜！
I totally forgot to do it!

14
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,700
コメント動かないな…
The comments aren't moving...

15
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:27,700
今日動かない日なのかな？
Is today one of those days where they don't load?

16
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,300
どうなんじゃろうか…
I wonder what's up...

17
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,900
よいしょ
Up we go.

18
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,000
無理そう、諦めよう
Seems impossible, I'll give up.

19
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:38,000
ど忘れしてた、ちょっと仕込みを仕込みをしていたら…
I completely forgot, I was preparing a little trick...

20
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,800
ひっそりと仕込みをしていたら…
While I was quietly getting things ready...

21
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,200
忘れていたのじゃ
I totally forgot about it.

22
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,300
のじゃ！
Noja!

23
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,000
今日は…
Today...

24
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,800
今日は…
Today is...

25
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,600
ボカロ歌枠ー！
...a Vocaloid karaoke stream!

26
00:03:56,500 --> 00:04:00,300
VOCALOID、もしくはVOCALOIDに限らず合成音声を…
Songs using Vocaloid, or voice synthesizers in general...

27
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,100
使用した楽曲の…
...I'll be singing...

28
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,800
を歌う…
...songs that use...

29
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,100
歌枠ですのじゃ！
...voice synth in this karaoke stream!

30
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,900
のじゃー！
Nojaa!

31
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:11,700
あのね…
You know...

32
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:16,100
今までなんとまだ、ボカロ縛りをわしやったことないんじゃよ
Believe it or not, I've never done an all-Vocaloid stream until now!

33
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,500
初配信から…
Ever since my debut...

34
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,700
あの自分が如何にボーカロイドが好きか、如何に合成音声が好きかみたいな…
I talked about how much I love Vocaloid and voice synthesizers...

35
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,500
普段ボカロしか聞かないからね
...and how I usually only listen to Vocaloid music.

36
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:29,200
みたいなの言っていた割に…
Despite saying all that...

37
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:33,800
「こいつ全然歌枠でボカロ歌わないな」と多分思われていたと思うのじゃ
...everyone probably thought, "She hardly sings any Vocaloid songs in her karaoke streams."

38
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,700
やっぱ最初はね…
Well, at first...

39
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:37,300
最初はね…
At first, you know...

40
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:41,700
ボカロも歌ったことあるよ！『サラマンダー』とかも歌枠で歌ったことあるけど…
I have sung Vocaloid before! Like "Salamander" in previous karaoke streams, but...

41
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:45,300
その割合的にはそんな多めじゃなかったんじゃよ
...the proportion of Vocaloid songs wasn't that high.

42
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,800
でも、そろそろ…
But, it's about time...

43
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,700
そろそろ全曲…
It's about time to do an all-Vocaloid...

44
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,600
ボカロの歌枠…
...karaoke stream...

45
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:55,600
やってみてもいいんじゃない？もうそろそろ1ヶ月…もうそろ、もう1ヶ月？
...don't you think? It's almost been a month... wait, is it already a month?

46
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,600
もう1ヶ月じゃし
It's already been a month since debut, so...

47
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,200
そう思って
...that's what I thought.

48
00:05:02,008 --> 00:05:03,308
持って来ようと思って。
I thought I'd bring it.

49
00:05:03,708 --> 00:05:08,108
そう、歌おうかなと思って。
Yeah, I thought I'd sing...

50
00:05:09,408 --> 00:05:17,508
あの、以前Twitterで、わしのTwitterでね、おぬしらにリクエストを募集したのじゃ。
You see, before, I asked for song requests from all of you on my Twitter.

51
00:05:18,008 --> 00:05:21,408
どんなボカロ曲歌ってほしい、みたいなぁ。
Like, "What Vocaloid songs would you like me to sing?"

52
00:05:21,808 --> 00:05:26,608
そう。どの曲歌ってほしい？みたいなのを聞いて。
Yeah, asking like "Which songs do you want me to sing?"...

53
00:05:27,508 --> 00:05:32,508
今回はじゃから、そのわしがゼロから考えたセットリストというよりは…もちろん考えたんじゃけど。
So this time, rather than a setlist I came up with from scratch—well, of course I did come up with it—

54
00:05:33,008 --> 00:05:40,208
あの、リクエストで来てた曲をせっかくだし、そこからピックアップして歌おうかなと思って。
since people gave requests, I thought I'd pick from those and sing them.

55
00:05:41,008 --> 00:05:43,708
みぃ、みぃ。
Me... me.

56
00:05:44,008 --> 00:05:52,008
そう。人間たちが聞きだがってる曲を歌ってみようかなと思って選んでみたのじゃ。
Yeah, I thought I'd try singing songs that humans want to hear, so I picked them.

57
00:05:52,808 --> 00:05:56,008
でもね、たくさんリプをいただいて…
But you know, I got so many replies...

58
00:05:56,508 --> 00:06:01,808
あの、1,000個以上、1,000個以上のリプライをいただいたので…
Over 1,000... I received over 1,000 replies, so...

59
00:06:02,008 --> 00:06:04,508
あの、全曲はもちろん歌えないので。
of course I can't sing every single song.

60
00:06:05,008 --> 00:06:13,808
まあ、いずれね、ちょっとずつちょっとずつ、ちょっとずつちょっとずついろんな歌枠で歌っていこうかなと。
Well, eventually, bit by bit, little by little across various singing streams, I'm thinking of singing them...

61
00:06:14,008 --> 00:06:18,808
思って、おりましたのじゃ。
...that's what I was thinking.

62
00:06:19,008 --> 00:06:23,008
まあ、少しずつね。1,000個いきなり歌えないからね、わしだってね。
Well, step by step. Even I can't suddenly sing 1,000 songs, after all.

63
00:06:26,008 --> 00:06:32,808
そう、まあ、ちょっとずつよ。ちょっとずつ歌っていこうと思っていますのじゃ。
Yeah, just bit by bit. I plan to sing them little by little.

64
00:06:34,008 --> 00:06:38,508
今日どれくらい…え、どれくらいだっけな？待ってね。
How many today... Wait, how many was it? Hold on.

65
00:06:39,008 --> 00:06:49,808
えっとね、今日は、6…3、4、5、6、7…7、8曲くらい？
Um, today, 6... 3, 4, 5, 6, 7... about 7 or 8 songs?

66
00:06:50,008 --> 00:06:53,508
7、8曲くらい歌おうかなと思って来ましたのじゃ。
I came planning to sing about 7 or 8 songs.

67
00:06:55,008 --> 00:07:01,808
500曲くらい？そんな歌えないのじゃ！1枠で500曲も歌えないのじゃ！喉が死ぬのじゃ！
Around 500 songs? I can't sing that many! I can't sing 500 songs in one stream! My throat would die!

68
00:07:02,508 --> 00:07:05,008
なのでゆっくりね。
So, nice and easy.

69
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:13,008
はい。まあ歌枠ね、雑談多いのもあれなんで、歌っていこうかなと思いますーが…
Yes. Well, having too much talking in a karaoke stream isn't great either, so I'm thinking of singing, but...

70
00:07:13,208 --> 00:07:15,208
あ、そう！あのさ…
Oh, right! Hey, guys...

71
00:07:15,308 --> 00:07:20,008
あの、メンバーシップのね、スタンプにね…
You know, for the membership stickers...

72
00:07:20,208 --> 00:07:29,508
えっと、標識？標識のイラストを先ほど描かせていただいて、ペンライトの代わりに追加させていただきましたのじゃ。
um, signboards? I drew an illustration of signboards earlier and added them as a substitute for penlights!

73
00:07:29,808 --> 00:07:35,508
興味がある方はぜひメンバーシップ入ってみてください。そしてメンギフとかもありがとうなんのじゃー！
If you're interested, please do join the membership! And thank you for the membership gifts as well!

74
00:07:35,608 --> 00:07:40,008
メンバーシップ入ってないよって人は、どうしようかな、水色のハートのエモジとかいいんじゃない？
For those who aren't members, how about sending light blue heart emojis instead?

75
00:07:40,208 --> 00:07:46,208
水色のハートのエモジとかをいっぱい書くといいんじゃない？
Wouldn't it be great to fill the chat with light blue heart emojis?

76
00:07:46,508 --> 00:07:53,008
みたいなので送ると弾幕になるのかなって思いますのじゃー！
I think sending those will turn into a nice chat barrage!

77
00:07:53,208 --> 00:07:56,008
よし！それでは、あ！
Alright! Now then... Ah!

78
00:07:56,208 --> 00:07:59,208
移動する前に、移動する前に、おぬしら！
Before we move on... before we move on, you guys!

79
00:07:59,508 --> 00:08:02,808
もう高評価ボタンは押してくれたかの？
Have you pressed the Like button already?

80
00:08:03,008 --> 00:08:09,508
熱千めらちゃんのボカロ歌枠、超楽しみだよね、おぬしら！楽しみのおぬしら！
"Mela-chan's Vocaloid singing stream is so exciting, right, guys?" Aren't you excited?

81
00:08:10,008 --> 00:08:16,008
おぬしらが高評価ボタンを押すことによって、わしがお面を外して…
By pressing the Like button, I might take off my mask and...

82
00:08:16,208 --> 00:08:22,508
ええ、お面外れてないよね、わし。外れてないじゃろ？お面付いてるじゃろ、最初から。
Uh, my mask hasn't fallen off, right? It's still on, isn't it? It's been on from the beginning, right?

83
00:08:23,008 --> 00:08:33,008
おぬしらが高評価ボタンを押すことによって、わしがお面を外してお歌を歌おうかなって思いますのじゃー！
By pressing the Like button, I'm thinking of taking off my mask and singing songs for you!

84
00:08:33,208 --> 00:08:38,508
それではおぬしら、高評価おねがいしますのじゃ！移動しますのじゃー！
So everyone, please hit that Like button! Time to move on!

85
00:08:38,808 --> 00:08:40,808
のじゃー！よいしょー！
Here we go! Yoisho!

86
00:08:42,208 --> 00:08:44,508
やばい！ハプニング起きちゃった！
Oh no! An accident happened!

87
00:08:45,508 --> 00:08:51,008
もう駄目だ、わし今日。わし今日駄目かも。わし今日駄目かも。なんかい…
I'm hopeless today. I might be hopeless today. I might be useless today. Somehow...

88
00:08:52,008 --> 00:08:59,508
今日ね、あの頭がね、頭がぽやぽやしてるかもね、わし。
Today, my head feels all woozy and spacey.

89
00:09:00,008 --> 00:09:08,008
うん、今日わし頭ぽやぽやデーかもね。なんだか…なんだかそんな予感。
Yeah, today might be a spacey-head day for me. Somehow... I just have that feeling.

90
00:09:08,208 --> 00:09:14,508
疲れて…ない。なんじゃろ、昨日あのインフルエンザの予防接種打ったらめっちゃ悪夢見るのじゃ。
Tired... no. What is it? Yesterday I got a flu shot and I've been having crazy nightmares.

91
00:09:14,808 --> 00:09:20,508
めっちゃ悪夢見る。めっちゃ悪夢見て、それかな？関係あるかな？
Having so many nightmares. Had such terrible nightmares, maybe that's it? Is it related?

92
00:09:23,008 --> 00:09:28,508
風邪、風邪も引いてないと思うけどな。ちょっとコメント動かないのはごめんじゃけど諦めてほしい。
A cold... I don't think I caught a cold though. Sorry that the chat isn't moving, but please bear with it.

93
00:09:28,808 --> 00:09:32,808
今日はそういう日。今日はコメントが動かない日！
Today is just that kind of day. Today is a day where the chat doesn't move!

94
00:09:34,008 --> 00:09:41,008
現実とはそういうもの。常に、常に最高のコンディションを出せるわけではないということ。
That's just reality. You can't always, ALWAYS bring out your absolute best condition.

95
00:09:42,008 --> 00:09:43,008
よし！
Alright!

96
00:09:43,208 --> 00:09:50,808
さて、えー…歌を、歌っていこうと思いますのじゃー！
Now then, um... I'm going to start singing the songs!

97
00:09:51,008 --> 00:09:56,808
1曲目はね、おぬしら今日何月何日知ってる？
For the first song... do you know what today's date is, everyone?

98
00:09:57,208 --> 00:10:00,008
効いてる効いてる、ワクチン副作用笑った。
"It's taking effect, taking effect!" LOL at the vaccine side effects.

99
00:10:00,508 --> 00:10:05,508
おぬしら、今日は何月何日知ってるかのー？
Do you know what today's date is, everyone?

100
00:10:06,916 --> 00:10:07,816
もうすぐ
Soon,

101
00:10:08,116 --> 00:10:09,416
イベントが
there's an event

102
00:10:09,616 --> 00:10:12,316
あるよね 10月28日
coming up, right? October 28th.

103
00:10:12,816 --> 00:10:13,716
ということは
Which means...

104
00:10:13,916 --> 00:10:15,616
10月の後半に
in the second half of October,

105
00:10:15,916 --> 00:10:17,416
イベントが
there's an event...

106
00:10:18,716 --> 00:10:21,516
ニワトリの日？そうなん？そうなんじゃ、知らなかった。
Chicken Day? Is that so? I didn't know that!

107
00:10:22,816 --> 00:10:25,416
ハロウィンがありますね！クリスマスは早いね！
We have Halloween! Christmas is too early!

108
00:10:26,016 --> 00:10:28,916
ハロウィンがありますのじゃ！ということで
We have Halloween! So with that...

109
00:10:29,716 --> 00:10:31,016
よいしょ
Up we go...

110
00:10:31,716 --> 00:10:34,116
やっぱ季節感を出していきたい VTuberとして
I want to bring out the seasonal vibe as a VTuber.

111
00:10:34,716 --> 00:10:38,416
VTuberとして季節感を出していきたいと思い
Thinking I should bring out the seasonal feel as a VTuber...

112
00:10:39,216 --> 00:10:40,016
よいしょ
Here we go.

113
00:10:40,516 --> 00:10:43,416
ハロウィンの曲を歌わせていただきますのじゃ！
I will sing a Halloween song!

114
00:10:43,816 --> 00:10:47,216
Junkyさんの『Happy Halloween』を
Junky's "Happy Halloween"...

115
00:10:47,416 --> 00:10:48,516
歌います
...I will sing.

116
00:10:49,616 --> 00:10:50,816
歌いますのじゃ
I'll sing it!

117
00:10:51,316 --> 00:10:53,316
それでは それでは
Now then, now then...

118
00:10:54,016 --> 00:10:56,016
1曲目歌っていきますのじゃ！
I'll start singing the first song!

119
00:10:56,416 --> 00:10:58,516
よいしょ よいしょ
Here we go, here we go.

120
00:11:00,016 --> 00:11:01,216
歌詞は出てるかな？
Are the lyrics showing?

121
00:11:02,216 --> 00:11:02,916
出た！
They're up!

122
00:11:03,216 --> 00:11:05,216
のーちゃん！
No-chan!

123
00:11:10,816 --> 00:11:13,416
歌いますのじゃ！じゃーじゃー
I'm gonna sing! Ta-da!

124
00:11:21,516 --> 00:11:25,416
小悪魔でもいいし カボチャとかでもいいかもね もしかしてこの曲は
Maybe a little devil, or maybe a pumpkin would fit this song well!

125
00:11:29,916 --> 00:11:34,616
ねぇ もう暗くなりそうだから 出ちゃってもいいかしら？
Hey, it's getting dark, so is it okay if I come out?

126
00:11:35,016 --> 00:11:39,516
ちょっとね 魔法にかけられたの
Wait a bit, a spell has been cast on me.

127
00:11:39,816 --> 00:11:46,016
キミのお菓子から 食べちゃうぞ
I'm gonna start by eating your sweets!

128
00:11:54,016 --> 00:11:58,516
きっと もう霧が濃くなるから みんな集まるかな？
Surely the fog is getting thicker, so will everyone gather?

129
00:11:58,816 --> 00:12:03,516
じっと待って アマイモノ我慢した
I waited patiently, holding back from sweets.

130
00:12:03,816 --> 00:12:06,016
ご褒美を ほら
Here comes my reward!

131
00:12:06,216 --> 00:12:15,516
ひとつ ふたつ 鐘の音 騒ぎ出す 小さいオバケたち
One, two, the ringing bells, the little ghosts start getting noisy.

132
00:12:15,716 --> 00:12:23,516
今日は許してくれるの さあ街に行こう
They'll forgive us today, so come on, let's head into town!

133
00:12:23,816 --> 00:12:28,516
だって Happy Halloween 悪戯しちゃうぞ ding-dong-dang
Because it's Happy Halloween, we'll play tricks, ding-dong-dang!

134
00:12:28,816 --> 00:12:33,216
あっちもこっちも trick or treat キャンディーはくれないの？
Trick or treat here and there! Won't you give me any candy?

135
00:12:33,416 --> 00:12:38,016
だって Happy Halloween 幼気なランタンパンプキン
Because it's Happy Halloween, the innocent lantern pumpkin,

136
00:12:38,216 --> 00:12:42,516
疲れたジャックも踊るよ 朝まで
Even tired Jack will dance until morning!

137
00:12:42,716 --> 00:12:47,216
だって Happy Halloween オバケのカブだってラララ
Because it's Happy Halloween, even ghost turnips go la-la-la!

138
00:12:47,416 --> 00:12:52,016
今日は街中 trick or treat チョコも頂戴よ
Today the whole town is trick or treat, give me some chocolate too!

139
00:12:52,216 --> 00:12:56,816
だって Happy Halloween 不思議な世界へようこそ
Because it's Happy Halloween, welcome to a mysterious world!

140
00:12:57,016 --> 00:13:01,016
疲れたジャックも歌うよ Let's trick or treat
Even tired Jack will sing, Let's trick or treat!

141
00:13:01,216 --> 00:13:05,016
え、声弱いかな？つけたんじゃけどな。あー、響いてるかいの？
Eh, is my voice weak? I turned it up though. Ah, is it echoing?

142
00:13:18,516 --> 00:13:28,516
おぬしらトリックオアトリートなのじゃー！高評価をねだってますのじゃー！のーじゃー！
You guys, trick or treat! I'm begging for likes! No-ja!

143
00:13:38,016 --> 00:13:46,016
もっともっとほしい 欲張りゴースト
I want more and more, greedy ghost.

144
00:13:46,216 --> 00:13:54,516
もうない？ それなら悪戯の餌食ね
No more? Then you're the prey for my tricks!

145
00:13:56,016 --> 00:14:01,516
のーじゃー！悪戯の餌食ですのじゃー！
No-ja! You're the prey for my tricks!

146
00:14:05,816 --> 00:14:13,516
くれない家なんて庭木に トイレットペーパー ぐるぐるにしちゃえ
For houses that don't give any, let me wrap their garden trees in toilet paper!

147
00:14:13,816 --> 00:14:21,516
今夜はランタン灯してるなら 甘いの頂戴 さあ Let's Party Night
Tonight, if your lantern is lit, give me something sweet, come on, Let's Party Night!

148
00:14:21,716 --> 00:14:26,216
ほら だって Happy Halloween 時計も回る tick-tack
Look, because it's Happy Halloween, the clock ticks away, tick-tack!

149
00:14:26,416 --> 00:14:31,016
あっちもこっちも trick or treat 目も眩むパンプキンパイ
Trick or treat here and there! Dazzling pumpkin pie!

150
00:14:31,216 --> 00:14:35,616
だって Happy Halloween だから夜更かししちゃうじゃない
Because it's Happy Halloween, so of course we're staying up late!

151
00:14:35,816 --> 00:14:40,216
疲れたジャックも寝ないわ 朝まで
Even tired Jack won't sleep until morning!

152
00:14:40,416 --> 00:14:48,516
だって Happy Halloween... だって Happy Halloween...
Because it's Happy Halloween... Because it's Happy Halloween...

153
00:14:48,816 --> 00:14:53,016
今日は Happy Halloween さあ Let's trick or treat
Today is Happy Halloween! Come on, Let's trick or treat!

154
00:14:53,216 --> 00:14:58,016
赤いキャンディー転がして 朝まで寝たくない
Rolling around a red candy, I don't want to sleep until morning!

155
00:15:08,184 --> 00:15:12,864
Happy Halloween であったのじゃ
Happy Halloween, it was noja!

156
00:15:13,474 --> 00:15:16,744
おぬしら Trick or Treat なのじゃ
You guys, trick or treat noja!

157
00:15:18,404 --> 00:15:23,324
さっき「イタズラされたいから高評価したくない」ってコメント見た
I just saw a comment saying "I don't want to leave a like because I want to be pranked."

158
00:15:23,904 --> 00:15:26,524
どちらでも トリック トリック アンド トリート
Either way, trick, trick & treat!

159
00:15:26,804 --> 00:15:28,444
どちらだっていいのじゃ
Either is fine noja!

160
00:15:28,604 --> 00:15:31,584
どちらだって褒められたいのじゃわしは
Either way, I just want to be praised!

161
00:15:33,204 --> 00:15:35,424
のじゃー
Noja~!

162
00:15:39,424 --> 00:15:43,424
お菓子もらった お菓子もらった
I got treats, I got treats!

163
00:15:44,564 --> 00:15:47,224
トリック望まれてる なぜだか
Tricks are requested... I wonder why.

164
00:15:48,044 --> 00:15:51,024
人間はイタズラされたいらしい
Humans seem to want to be pranked.

165
00:15:52,064 --> 00:15:56,584
そういう勢力もいるよね 多様性なのじゃ
There are people like that too, right? Diversity noja!

166
00:15:57,544 --> 00:16:01,724
さて 歌枠はポンポン歌っていきたい派
Well, in singing streams, I'm the type who likes to sing song after song.

167
00:16:01,824 --> 00:16:02,904
あ！
Ah!

168
00:16:03,644 --> 00:16:07,344
そう！今日わしが仮面外すの忘れた理由おぬしらに教えてあげよう
That's right! I'll tell you guys why I forgot to take off my mask today!

169
00:16:07,904 --> 00:16:13,824
今日何でわしが仮面を外すの忘れたか 仕込みをしてきたからなのじゃ！どんな仕込みをしてきたか
Why did I forget to take off my mask today? Because I prepared a special surprise! What kind of surprise?

170
00:16:24,904 --> 00:16:29,304
ハロウィンじゃし仮装しようかなと思って
It's Halloween, so I thought I'd wear a costume...

171
00:16:31,124 --> 00:16:40,924
ハロウィンだし ハロウィンだし 仮装してみようかなと思って
Since it's Halloween, since it's Halloween, I thought I'd try dressing up!

172
00:16:46,184 --> 00:16:48,144
豆つけてきた
I attached edamame beans!

173
00:16:51,224 --> 00:16:53,404
豆つけてきた
I attached edamame beans!

174
00:16:57,044 --> 00:16:59,944
のじゃ 語尾変える？
Noja! Should I change my verbal tic?

175
00:17:01,104 --> 00:17:09,444
語尾って何の話なの だ？わしは元々語尾はこれなのだ！のだー！
What's this talk about verbal tics noda? Originally my verbal tic was this noda! Noda~!

176
00:17:14,204 --> 00:17:17,144
豆つけてきたのだ
I attached edamame beans noda!

177
00:17:19,924 --> 00:17:25,404
歌おうかなと思って 歌おうかなと思って
I thought about singing, thought about singing...

178
00:17:26,124 --> 00:17:32,564
はい 本日は合成音声曲縛りですね！合成音声曲縛りで
Yes, today is synthetic voice songs only! Synthetic voice songs only!

179
00:17:33,204 --> 00:17:38,984
なんか 豆がついている つまり そう ずんだもんの曲ですね！
There's a bean on me... Which means, yes, a Zundamon song!

180
00:17:39,304 --> 00:17:42,584
ずんだもんの曲を歌わせていただきますのじゃ
I will be singing a Zundamon song noja!

181
00:17:43,864 --> 00:17:52,344
なんか そう あれも合成音声 初見はカエルなのじゃ？ それは違うのじゃ 非公式なのじゃ それは
Wait, is the first impression a frog? That's wrong noja! That's unofficial noja!

182
00:17:55,044 --> 00:18:04,624
なんかね あ、そう ボカロっていうと ずんだもんはVOCALOIDではないが 合成音声と呼ぶからには合成音声なのじゃ
Speaking of Vocaloid, Zundamon isn't a Vocaloid, but as far as synthetic voice goes, it is synthetic voice noja.

183
00:18:06,844 --> 00:18:12,864
そう 何を歌うか あの 察しのいいおぬしらもいると思うのじゃが
So, what am I singing? I think some of you sharp folks might have guessed...

184
00:18:13,444 --> 00:18:20,004
なんかリクエストで来てて わしがね なんじゃったかな 夜勤事件かな？何かの配信の時に
It came as a request... During what stream was it, Night Delivery? During some stream,

185
00:18:20,404 --> 00:18:31,064
あの ずんだもんのとある曲をね ちょっとちらっと口ずさんじゃってたっぽくて 無意識に口ずさんでたっぽくて じゃから聴きたいって言われたんだよね
I seemed to have subconsciously hummed a certain Zundamon song... I subconsciously hummed it, so people asked to hear it!

186
00:18:37,904 --> 00:18:45,164
はい えー ずんだもんの「ずんだパーリナイ」という曲を 歌わせていただきますのじゃ
Yes, I will be singing Zundamon's song "Zunda Party Night" noja!

187
00:18:47,024 --> 00:18:56,024
初見はカエルなのじゃ？ それは違うのじゃ それはずんだもんじゃないのじゃ 公式じゃないの... 公式じゃないよねあれ？さすがに...
First impression a frog? That's wrong noja! That's not Zundamon! That's not official... Wait, is it not official? Surely...

188
00:18:57,064 --> 00:19:00,704
あれ非公式がなん... 混ざっちゃっただけじゃよね
An unofficial one just got mixed in, right?

189
00:19:04,024 --> 00:19:08,844
それでは 歌わせていただきますのじゃ
Well then, I will proceed to sing noja!

190
00:19:09,164 --> 00:19:14,584
なみぐるさんの ずんだパーリナイ
Namiguru-san's "Zunda Party Night"!

191
00:19:14,904 --> 00:19:21,564
ずんだもんって曲出してたんだ？ VOCALOIDとか まぁこれはVOICEVOXなんじゃけど 合成音声って
Did Zundamon release songs? Vocaloid or... well, this is VOICEVOX, but synthetic voices...

192
00:19:21,844 --> 00:19:34,504
その 何ていうのかな そのキャラクターが曲を出してるというよりは ボカロPさんが作曲して ずんだもんの二次創作として曲が出されているみたいな イメージですのじゃ
How should I put it, rather than the character releasing the song, a Vocaloid producer composes it and releases it as a derivative work featuring Zundamon, that kind of image noja.

193
00:19:37,044 --> 00:19:41,364
それでは 歌っていきますのじゃ ずんだパーリナイ！
Well then, I'm going to sing noja! Zunda Party Night!

194
00:19:42,524 --> 00:19:46,024
[Text: ずんだパーリナイ / ♪ なみぐる / 作詞 作曲 なみぐる]
[Text: Zunda Party Night / ♪ Namiguru / Lyrics & Composition: Namiguru]

195
00:19:45,044 --> 00:19:47,264
むずいんだな いけるかな
It's hard, can I do it?

196
00:19:54,884 --> 00:19:57,364
のだだだだ のだだだだ ZUNZUN 僕と一緒に踊るのだ！
Nodadadada nodadadada ZUNZUN Dance with me noda!

197
00:19:57,504 --> 00:20:02,024
(Ah) もっちもっちずんだ もっちもっちずんだ
(Ah) Chewy chewy zunda, chewy chewy zunda!

198
00:20:02,032 --> 00:20:03,832
ずんだ もっちもっちもちずんだ
Zunda, squishy squishy zunda

199
00:20:03,832 --> 00:20:05,532
もっちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda

200
00:20:05,532 --> 00:20:07,532
もっちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda

201
00:20:07,532 --> 00:20:10,232
もっちもちずんだ もっちもちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy squishy zunda

202
00:20:10,232 --> 00:20:12,032
Yeah! 皆さん ずんばんわ
Yeah! Good zun-evening, everyone!

203
00:20:12,032 --> 00:20:15,632
ずんだパーティーの時間だよ キミもイタコもずんこもきりたんも
It's Zunda Party time! You, Itako, Zunko, and Kiritan too!

204
00:20:15,632 --> 00:20:16,932
よ〜おし ダンシング!
Al-right, let's dance!

205
00:20:16,932 --> 00:20:19,632
メーデー メーデー メーデー ベイベー 陽気なフライデー
Mayday mayday mayday baby, cheerful Friday

206
00:20:19,632 --> 00:20:23,032
ずんだブランデー ひっかけて 実行せよプランA
Knock back some zunda brandy and execute Plan A

207
00:20:23,032 --> 00:20:26,032
ちょっぴりレアだぜ アンモン
It's a bit rare, anmon

208
00:20:26,032 --> 00:20:29,232
ピリッと辛いぜ カルダモン
Spicy and sharp, cardamom

209
00:20:29,232 --> 00:20:32,332
のだのだのだのだ ZUN ZUN のだのだのだのだ
Noda-noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN noda-noda-noda-noda

210
00:20:32,332 --> 00:20:35,432
ずんだパーリナイ 恋が止まらない
Zunda party night, love won't stop

211
00:20:35,432 --> 00:20:38,532
ずっとおませなお豆じゃいられない
Can't stay a precocious bean forever

212
00:20:38,532 --> 00:20:41,732
ずんだパーリナイ 生じゃ味気ない
Zunda party night, raw is so bland

213
00:20:41,732 --> 00:20:45,332
ちょいと砂糖と塩で化粧したい
Want to put on makeup with a bit of sugar and salt

214
00:20:45,332 --> 00:20:51,132
時計も時間も忘れて踊り出す
Forgetting clocks and time, starting to dance

215
00:20:51,132 --> 00:20:57,732
カッカッカッカッカッカッカッ カルダモン カッカッカッカッカッカッカッ カルダモン
Ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka cardamom, ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka cardamom

216
00:20:57,732 --> 00:21:00,732
もっちもちずんだ もっちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy zunda

217
00:21:00,732 --> 00:21:04,332
もっちもちずんだ もっちもちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy squishy zunda

218
00:21:04,332 --> 00:21:10,032
もっちもちずんだ もっちもちずんだ もっちもちずんだ もっちもちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy squishy zunda

219
00:21:10,032 --> 00:21:14,132
一富士 二鷹 三ずんだ
First Mt. Fuji, second hawk, third Zunda

220
00:21:14,132 --> 00:21:17,532
あずき枕で夢心地
Dreaming peacefully on an azuki pillow

221
00:21:17,532 --> 00:21:20,532
ずんだの道も一歩から
Even the way of zunda starts with a single step

222
00:21:20,532 --> 00:21:23,832
マメなメンズはモテるのだ!
Diligent guys are popular, noda!

223
00:21:23,832 --> 00:21:26,832
ギャテギャテ ペイディ歓迎 みなぎるサタデーナイ
Gate gate, Paydy welcome, overflowing Saturday night

224
00:21:26,832 --> 00:21:30,032
すぐにblenderを立ち上げて 創造せよプランB
Launch blender right away and create Plan B

225
00:21:30,032 --> 00:21:33,032
炎に強いぜ アンチモン
Strong against flames, antimony

226
00:21:33,032 --> 00:21:36,032
ひとつ(1)やろうぜ サクラダモン
Let's do one, Sakuradamon

227
00:21:36,032 --> 00:21:39,432
のだのだのだのだ ZUN ZUN のだのだのだ ZUN ZUN HO!
Noda-noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN HO!

228
00:21:39,432 --> 00:21:42,432
ずんだパーリナイ もう止まれない
Zunda party night, can't stop now

229
00:21:42,432 --> 00:21:45,732
今夜一皮むけなきゃ変われない
Got to shed a layer tonight to change

230
00:21:45,732 --> 00:21:48,832
ずんだパーリナイ こんなんじゃ終われない
Zunda party night, it can't end like this

231
00:21:48,832 --> 00:21:52,032
ちょいと素材の味で勝負したい
Want to compete with the natural flavor of ingredients

232
00:21:52,032 --> 00:21:58,032
世界の終わりにずんだを食べるのだ (ギターソロ!)
Eating zunda at the end of the world! (Guitar solo!)

233
00:21:58,032 --> 00:22:10,032
ずすんだずん ずすんだずん ずすんだずんずんずすんだずん
Zu-zunda-zun, zu-zunda-zun, zu-zunda-zun-zun zu-zunda-zun

234
00:22:10,032 --> 00:22:14,032
ずすんだずん HO!
Zu-zunda-zun HO!

235
00:22:14,032 --> 00:22:20,832
カッカッカッカッカッカッカッ カルダモン カッカッカッカッカッカッカッ カルダモン
Ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka cardamom, ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka cardamom

236
00:22:20,832 --> 00:22:31,832
もっちもちずんだ もっちもちずんだ もっちもちずんだ もっちもちもちずんだ
Squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy zunda, squishy squishy squishy zunda

237
00:22:31,832 --> 00:22:37,332
のだのだのだのだ ZUN ZUN のだのだのだ ZUN ZUN ZUZUN HO!
Noda-noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN ZUZUN HO!

238
00:22:37,332 --> 00:22:42,532
は〜じゃ〜
Phew~

239
00:22:46,232 --> 00:22:51,032
仮装おしまい 仮装おしまい
Costume off... costume off.

240
00:22:53,532 --> 00:22:56,832
ずんだパーリナイでしたのじゃ
That was "Zunda Party Night".

241
00:22:57,232 --> 00:23:04,032
なんか あの… お主ら これ分かってほしいんじゃけれど
Well, um... I hope you guys can understand this, but...

242
00:23:04,532 --> 00:23:11,532
好きな曲聴くでしょ？曲を聴くことってあるじゃないですか 我輩もあるの あるじゃろ？
You listen to songs you like, right? You have times when you listen to music, don't you? I do too. You know what I mean, right?

243
00:23:12,032 --> 00:23:15,532
歌うのってまた別なの！
Singing them is a completely different story!

244
00:23:15,832 --> 00:23:24,032
我輩ね ずんだパーリナイ聴いたことはあったんじゃけど 初めて歌ったから かなり練習した
You see, I've heard "Zunda Party Night" before, but since it was my first time singing it, I practiced a whole lot.

245
00:23:25,032 --> 00:23:30,032
昨日から練習した… コソ練してたんのじゃ
I've been practicing since yesterday... secretly practicing it.

246
00:23:31,032 --> 00:23:38,032
うん なんか聴いてたらさ 意外といけるかな？みたいに思ってたんじゃけど
Yeah, when listening to it, I thought, "Maybe I can manage this?"

247
00:23:38,232 --> 00:23:46,032
実際にリズムに合わせて歌うと早くて難しくて… コソ練したのじゃ
But actually singing it to the rhythm was so fast and difficult... So I did secret practice.

248
00:23:46,032 --> 00:23:50,032
そう ギリギリまで コソ練してたんのじゃ
Yeah, right up until the last minute, I was secretly practicing.

249
00:23:50,532 --> 00:23:52,532
難しかった！
It was so hard!

250
00:23:52,832 --> 00:23:57,032
のだのだのだのだ ZUN ZUN
"Noda-noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN"

251
00:23:57,032 --> 00:24:02,032
そう でもめっちゃ好き のだのだのだのだ ZUN ZUN
Yeah, but I love it so much! "Noda-noda-noda-noda ZUN ZUN"

252
00:24:03,032 --> 00:24:05,532
うん のじゃ
Yeah.

253
00:24:05,832 --> 00:24:12,832
そう 人とサラマンダーが歌うこと あんまり想定されてない でもボカロって全部そうなの！
Right, it's not really assumed that humans or salamanders would sing it. But all Vocaloid songs are like that!

254
00:24:13,032 --> 00:24:15,032
基本的には
Basically.

255
00:24:15,032 --> 00:24:20,032
いや だから好きなんじゃよね 我輩 人間が歌えない曲が好きなの 我輩は
Yeah, that's why I love them! I love songs that humans can't sing.

256
00:24:20,532 --> 00:24:24,032
早くて高くてかっこいい曲が好きなのじゃ
I love fast, high-pitched, cool songs!

257
00:24:26,032 --> 00:24:28,532
さて 次なんじゃっけ？
Now then, what's next?

258
00:24:28,832 --> 00:24:32,032
セトリ見ちゃおう 次は何を歌おうとしたのかな？
Let's check the setlist. What was I going to sing next?

259
00:24:32,032 --> 00:24:35,032
ちら ちらちらちらちら はっ！
*Glance, glance, glance...* Ah!

260
00:24:37,032 --> 00:24:39,032
のじゃー！
Oh!

261
00:24:39,532 --> 00:24:46,032
次はメルトを歌おうかなと思って
Next, I'm thinking of singing "Melt".

262
00:24:48,032 --> 00:24:54,032
メルトもね なんかリクエストめちゃくちゃ多かったのじゃ めちゃくちゃ多かった
"Melt" had a ton of requests too! So many requests.

263
00:24:56,032 --> 00:24:59,032
から メルト歌おうかな〜
So I think I'll sing "Melt"~

264
00:24:59,032 --> 00:25:03,032
我輩さ メルトをさ 初めて聴いたとき…
You know, when I first heard "Melt"...

265
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:05,480
本当にボカロ初期
Honestly, back in the early Vocaloid days...

266
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:08,330
てかまだ知り立ての頃とかじゃったから
I mean, when I was still first getting into it...

267
00:25:10,080 --> 00:25:11,200
だから
So...

268
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:14,530
ボカロ知り立ての頃って
When you first discover Vocaloid...

269
00:25:14,980 --> 00:25:16,830
歌詞聞き取れなくない？
...aren't the lyrics hard to catch?

270
00:25:17,230 --> 00:25:18,980
なんなら今でも聞き取れないけどね、わし
Honestly, I still can't make them out even now.

271
00:25:19,280 --> 00:25:20,880
わしボカロめっちゃ聞くけど
I listen to Vocaloid all the time, but...

272
00:25:21,380 --> 00:25:22,880
あのー歌詞聞き取れないし
Well... I can't catch the lyrics, and...

273
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:27,780
誰が歌ってるかとかも 調整によっては全然判断つかない時あるのじゃ
depending on the tuning, you sometimes can't even tell who's singing.

274
00:25:30,780 --> 00:25:32,080
「メルト」の歌詞が
In the lyrics for "Melt"...

275
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:37,780
「メルト 溶けてしまいそう」なんじゃけど メルトじゃから溶けるんじゃけど
It's "Melt, tokete shimaisou" [I feel like melting], because it's Melt, right?

276
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:43,580
わし初めて「メルト」聴いた時 「メルトは私の理想」に聞こえた
When I first heard "Melt," it sounded like "Melt is my ideal" to me.

277
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:46,280
の、すごい覚えてる
I remember that so clearly.

278
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:48,880
全然聞き取れないの、ボカロって
Vocaloid lyrics are just so hard to make out.

279
00:25:49,230 --> 00:25:51,880
それもまた合成音声のいいところである
Though that's also part of the charm of synthesized speech.

280
00:25:54,080 --> 00:25:56,480
のじゃ。いや、音なんだよね、そう。
Indeed. Yeah, it's more about the sound, right?

281
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:58,380
そう。わかんないよね。
Right. You can't really tell.

282
00:25:59,180 --> 00:26:00,880
そう、「理想」に聞こえたの。
Yeah, it sounded like "ideal" [risou].

283
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:03,780
よし
Alright.

284
00:26:04,180 --> 00:26:04,980
それでは
Now then...

285
00:26:06,180 --> 00:26:07,480
メルト…
Melt...

286
00:26:07,730 --> 00:26:12,880
メルトどこが…あ、これか？これか？これか？
Where is Melt... Ah, this one? Is it this one? This one?

287
00:26:14,980 --> 00:26:15,780
よし
Alright!

288
00:26:16,780 --> 00:26:21,680
頑張っちゃうよ～！メルト歌っちゃうじゃー！よいしょ！
I'm gonna do my best! Singing Melt now! Here we go!

289
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:23,080
歌えるかな？
I wonder if I can sing it.

290
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:25,580
いや、ボカロイドってさ
Man, Vocaloid songs...

291
00:26:26,580 --> 00:26:29,580
ボカロイドが正解を叩き出すからさ
...Vocaloids set the absolute benchmark standard, you know?

292
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:35,980
人間が生歌でやるのがよ…
So when a human sings it live...

293
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,880
じゃあ…
Alright...

294
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:45,080
じゃーじゃーじゃーじゃーじゃー…
Daa daa daa daa daa...

295
00:26:49,380 --> 00:26:57,680
朝目が覚めて 真っ先に 思い浮かぶ 君のこと
The moment I wake up in the morning, / You are the first thing on my mind.

296
00:27:00,580 --> 00:27:08,680
思い切って 前髪を切った 「どうしたの？」って 聞かれたくて
Taking a leap of faith, I cut my bangs, / Wanting you to ask me, "What happened?"

297
00:27:10,980 --> 00:27:25,680
ピンクのスカート お花の髪飾り さして出かけるの 今日の私は かわいいのよ！
In a pink skirt with a flower hairpin, / I head out today looking... / So cute!

298
00:27:26,080 --> 00:27:36,480
メルト 溶けてしまいそう 好きだなんて 絶対に 言えない… だけど
Melt, I feel like melting! / I could never, ever tell you I like you... And yet,

299
00:27:36,980 --> 00:27:53,780
メルト 目も合わせられない 恋に恋なんてしないわ 私 だって 君のことが… 好きなの
Melt, I can't even lock eyes with you! / I'm not just in love with the idea of love... / Because what I love... is you!

300
00:27:56,880 --> 00:28:01,980
ラーラーラーラーラーラーラーラー…
La la la la la la la la...

301
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:13,980
天気予報が ウソをついた 土砂降りの雨が降る
The weather forecast lied, / And down comes a torrential downpour.

302
00:28:16,780 --> 00:28:27,780
カバンに入れたままの 折りたたみ傘 うれしくない ため息をついた そんなとき
The folding umbrella tucked in my bag brings me no joy. / As I let out a sigh right then...

303
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:37,480
「しょうがないから 入っ てやる」なんて 隣にいる きみが笑う
"Guess I've got no choice, I'll share it with you," / You laugh right beside me.

304
00:28:37,780 --> 00:28:41,480
恋に落ちる音がした
I heard the sound of falling in love.

305
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:51,080
メルト 息が詰まりそう 君に触れてる右手 が 震える
Melt, I feel like I can't breathe! / My right hand touching yours... / Is trembling.

306
00:28:51,480 --> 00:29:03,780
高鳴る胸 はんぶんこの傘 手を伸ばせば届く距離 どうしよう…！
My heart throbs under this shared umbrella, / A distance where reaching out could touch you... What do I do?!

307
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:08,280
想いよ届け 君に
Reach him, my feelings!

308
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:21,680
お願い時間を止めて 泣きそうなの でも嬉しくて 死んでしまうわ！
Please, time, stop right here... I'm about to cry, / But I'm so happy I could die!

309
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:50,480
ニャニャニャニャニャ…
Nya nya nya nya nya...

310
00:29:55,380 --> 00:30:03,980
メルト 駅に着いてしまう… もう会えない 近くて遠いよ だから
Melt, we're arriving at the station... / We won't see each other anymore today. So close, yet so far, so...

311
00:30:03,935 --> 00:30:05,285
もういいよ
I've had enough...

312
00:30:05,285 --> 00:30:07,135
だからメルト
So, Melt...

313
00:30:07,135 --> 00:30:10,535
手をつないで歩きたい！
I want to walk holding hands!

314
00:30:10,535 --> 00:30:17,135
もうバイバイしなくちゃ いけないの？
Do we really have to say goodbye now?

315
00:30:17,135 --> 00:30:22,335
今すぐわたしを 抱きしめて！
Hold me tight right now!

316
00:30:22,335 --> 00:30:24,235
...なんてね
...Just kidding.

317
00:30:24,235 --> 00:30:32,935
ららら...
La la la...

318
00:30:38,435 --> 00:30:42,135
ららら... じゃん！
La la la... Ta-da!

319
00:30:43,735 --> 00:30:50,435
『メルト』でしたのじゃ〜！ のじゃ〜！
That was "Melt"! Yes it was~!

320
00:30:51,735 --> 00:30:56,935
やはり、ボカロと言えばみたいなところ、ありましたよね？
As expected, when you think of Vocaloid, this song naturally comes to mind, right?

321
00:30:57,635 --> 00:31:09,935
ボカロと言えばみたいな曲ってめちゃくちゃあるけど、間違いなくめちゃくちゃある中の1つに上がりやすいとされている『メルト』でしたのじゃ〜！
There are tons of iconic Vocaloid songs, but "Melt" is definitely one that easily comes up among them, so that was it!

322
00:31:13,435 --> 00:31:18,435
そして、そして、そして...
And then, and then, and then...

323
00:31:18,435 --> 00:31:21,235
最後聞くと譜面が浮かぶ？
"Listening to the end makes the rhythm chart pop up in your head"?

324
00:31:21,235 --> 00:31:32,735
いや、わかるよ！ わしも分かってあげられる！ 曲聴いて音ゲーとかでやるとさ、やりすぎるとさ... 譜面浮かぶ時あるよね！ わしもめっちゃ分かるわ。
Ah, I totally get it! I feel you! When you play a song a lot in a rhythm game, if you overplay it... there are times when the note pattern floats in your mind, right? I totally get that too.

325
00:31:33,435 --> 00:31:39,435
supercell（ちょうちょうはん）様のさ、アレンジもいいよね！ あのアレンジも好きなのじゃ、結構。
Supercell's arrangement is also great, isn't it? I really like that arrangement too!

326
00:31:42,135 --> 00:31:47,835
よし、次！ よいしょ。 次何じゃっけ？ はっ！
Alright, next! Up we go! What was next again? Ah!

327
00:31:49,935 --> 00:32:00,935
これも多かった！ やはりボカロ... 合成音声を語る上で、DECO*27さんとは外せなくて...
This one had lots of requests too! After all, when talking about Vocaloid... or synthetic audio, DECO*27 is indispensable...

328
00:32:01,735 --> 00:32:05,735
DECO*27さんとは外せない存在で。
DECO*27 is an absolute must-have presence.

329
00:32:05,735 --> 00:32:15,735
何歌うかめちゃくちゃ悩んだんじゃけど、めちゃくちゃ悩んだんじゃけど、なんか可愛いのいくか！ と思って。
I was really torn on what to sing, really torn, but I thought, "Let's go with something cute!"

330
00:32:15,935 --> 00:32:20,935
『チェリーポップ』ってサビのメロディーがキャッチーすぎるのじゃ。
"Cherry Pop" has such an insanely catchy chorus melody!

331
00:32:23,935 --> 00:32:26,935
めっちゃ好き！ めっちゃ好きなのじゃ。
I love it so much! I really love it.

332
00:32:27,935 --> 00:32:33,935
よいしょ、えーっと... 待ってね。 あ、小っちゃくしちゃった。 よいしょ！ よいしょ！
Up we go... Let's see... Wait a sec. Ah, I made it small. Ups! There we go!

333
00:32:36,935 --> 00:32:44,435
えーっと、『チェリーポップ』『チェリーポップ』... これか。 よいしょ。 出せるか。
Let's see, "Cherry Pop", "Cherry Pop"... Is it this one? Ups! Can I display it?

334
00:32:48,435 --> 00:32:53,935
それでは... よいしょ。『チェリーポップ』...
Now then... Up we go. "Cherry Pop"...

335
00:32:55,935 --> 00:33:01,835
歌おうかな！ 歌うのじゃ〜！ よいしょ！
I guess I'll sing it! Singing now~! Up we go!

336
00:33:04,735 --> 00:33:09,435
[Title: チェリーポップ / DECO*27 作詞・作曲 DECO*27]
[Title: Cherry Pop / DECO*27 Lyrics & Composition: DECO*27]

337
00:33:12,435 --> 00:33:17,135
ちぇ ワーときどき ねーすきすき
Che! "Wa" sometimes, "Hey, love you love you"

338
00:33:17,135 --> 00:33:22,135
あーずきずき ちねちねちねちね
Ah, throbbing pain, squeeze, squeeze, squeeze, squeeze

339
00:33:22,135 --> 00:33:26,435
ワーときどき ねーすきすき あーずきずき
"Wa" sometimes, "Hey, love you love you", Ah, throbbing pain

340
00:33:26,435 --> 00:33:29,935
（あたし） 一等賞がほしいのよ
(Me) I want the first prize!

341
00:33:29,935 --> 00:33:31,935
二番なんて望んでない あーあい
I'm not wishing for second place, ah ah!

342
00:33:31,935 --> 00:33:35,935
みんなめんどくせっ て離れるの
Everyone says "She's a pain" and leaves

343
00:33:35,935 --> 00:33:37,435
重い子って不人気な んなん
"Heavy girls are unpopular", what's with that?

344
00:33:37,435 --> 00:33:39,435
あたし迷子 迷子で損な感じ
I'm a lost child, lost child, feeling like a loser

345
00:33:39,435 --> 00:33:41,135
本命になれないマン
Can't become the main girl, man!

346
00:33:41,135 --> 00:33:42,935
死んじまうわ
I'm gonna die!

347
00:33:42,935 --> 00:33:44,735
サイコ？ サイコはどっちどっち
Psycho? Who's the psycho, which one?

348
00:33:44,735 --> 00:33:46,735
おまえのことは顔しか
The only thing about you is your face!

349
00:33:46,735 --> 00:33:48,435
信じらんない！
I can't believe it!

350
00:33:48,435 --> 00:33:50,435
やってらんないね やってらんないね
Can't deal with this, can't deal with this!

351
00:33:50,435 --> 00:33:53,935
一生ぼっちかい？
Am I gonna be lonely for life?

352
00:33:53,935 --> 00:33:56,935
ありがとうさん やってられるか
Thank you very much, how can I deal with this?!

353
00:33:56,935 --> 00:34:00,435
つかたかったった！ まじで
Tired, tired, tired! Seriously!

354
00:34:00,435 --> 00:34:04,735
愛していい感 すきすき？ 恋していい感 すきすき？
"Can I love you?" vibe, love you love you? "Can I fall for you?" vibe, love you love you?

355
00:34:04,735 --> 00:34:08,935
どれみが怖いぞ チェリーチェリー
Do-Re-Mi is scary, Cherry Cherry

356
00:34:08,935 --> 00:34:12,935
そうでもない感 むりむり？ どうでもいい感 むりむり？
"Not really" vibe, no way no way? "Whatever" vibe, no way no way?

357
00:34:12,935 --> 00:34:17,135
トゲみが怖いぞ ベイビーベイビー
Prickly vibe is scary, Baby Baby

358
00:34:17,135 --> 00:34:20,935
愛していい感 すきすき？ 恋していい感 すきすき？
"Can I love you?" vibe, love you love you? "Can I fall for you?" vibe, love you love you?

359
00:34:20,935 --> 00:34:24,935
都合が良くてよ チェリーチェリー
That's convenient, Cherry Cherry

360
00:34:24,935 --> 00:34:28,935
そうでもない感 むりむり？ どうでもいい感 むりむり？
"Not really" vibe, no way no way? "Whatever" vibe, no way no way?

361
00:34:28,935 --> 00:34:33,935
出直してきなよ ベイビーベイビー
Come back after reflecting, Baby Baby

362
00:34:33,935 --> 00:34:35,935
いやーほんと
Man, seriously...

363
00:34:35,935 --> 00:34:40,435
ワーときどき ねーすきすき
"Wa" sometimes, "Hey, love you love you"

364
00:34:40,435 --> 00:34:45,435
あーずきずき ちねちねちねちね
Ah, throbbing pain, squeeze, squeeze, squeeze, squeeze

365
00:34:45,435 --> 00:34:49,435
ワーときどき ねーすきすき あーずきずき
"Wa" sometimes, "Hey, love you love you", Ah, throbbing pain

366
00:34:49,435 --> 00:34:52,935
（あたし） 一等賞がほしいのよ
(Me) I want the first prize!

367
00:34:52,935 --> 00:34:55,435
二番なんて望んでない あーあい
I'm not wishing for second place, ah ah!

368
00:34:55,435 --> 00:34:56,935
時に先生
Sometimes, teacher...

369
00:34:56,935 --> 00:34:59,135
好きとはなんですか
What is "love"?

370
00:34:59,135 --> 00:35:01,135
辞書にないやつをください あーあい
Give me the one that's not in the dictionary, ah ah!

371
00:35:01,135 --> 00:35:02,935
怒りぐっとこらえて言う
Holding back my anger, I say...

372
00:35:02,935 --> 00:35:03,935
「ごめんね」
"I'm sorry."

373
00:35:03,956 --> 00:35:05,336
トゲみが怖いくぞ チェリー チェリー
Cherry, cherry, I'm scared of sharp edges...

374
00:35:05,336 --> 00:35:06,896
そうでもない感 むり むり
Feels like it's not even that, no way, no way...

375
00:35:06,896 --> 00:35:08,556
どうでもいい感 むり むり
Feels like whatever, no way, no way...

376
00:35:08,556 --> 00:35:10,136
トゲみが怖いくぞ ベイビー ベイビー
Baby, baby, I'm scared of the sharp edges...

377
00:35:10,136 --> 00:35:11,696
愛していい感 すき すき
Feels like it's okay to love, love you, love you...

378
00:35:11,696 --> 00:35:13,276
恋していい感 すき すき
Feels like it's okay to fall in love, love you, love you...

379
00:35:13,276 --> 00:35:15,836
都合が良くてよ チェリー チェリー
Cherry, cherry, it's so convenient...

380
00:35:15,836 --> 00:35:17,436
そうでもない感 むり むり
Feels like it's not even that, no way, no way...

381
00:35:17,436 --> 00:35:18,976
どうでもいい感 むり むり
Feels like whatever, no way, no way...

382
00:35:18,976 --> 00:35:20,596
出直してきたのよ ベイビー ベイビー
Baby, baby, start over again!

383
00:35:20,596 --> 00:35:22,196
はい解散 わーどきどき
Okay, dismiss! Wow, my heart is pounding!

384
00:35:22,196 --> 00:35:23,776
ねーすきすき あーズキズキ
Hey, love you, love you, ah, throbbing!

385
00:35:23,776 --> 00:35:25,356
わーどきどき ねーすきすき
Wow, my heart is pounding! Hey, love you, love you!

386
00:35:25,356 --> 00:35:26,956
あーズキズキ ちねちねちねちね
Ah, throbbing! Die, die, die, die!

387
00:35:26,956 --> 00:35:28,536
わーどきどき ねーすきすき
Wow, my heart is pounding! Hey, love you, love you!

388
00:35:28,536 --> 00:35:30,116
あーズキズキ ちねちねちねちね
Ah, throbbing! Die, die, die, die!

389
00:35:30,116 --> 00:35:34,176
せーのっ
Ready, set...

390
00:35:34,956 --> 00:35:37,156
のじゃー！
Noja-!

391
00:35:41,016 --> 00:35:43,876
チェリーポップでしたのじゃ。
That was "Cherry Pop"!

392
00:35:44,356 --> 00:35:49,296
いやー！なー！
Wow! Man!

393
00:35:49,296 --> 00:35:52,816
めっちゃ好きなんじゃけどさ！めっちゃ好きなんじゃけどさ！
I really love this song, but... I really love it, but...

394
00:35:52,956 --> 00:35:58,636
あの、息継ぎするところがなくて！息継ぎするところがなくて！
Um, there's nowhere to take a breath! Nowhere to catch my breath!

395
00:35:58,956 --> 00:36:04,636
ちょっと息吸ってええか？息吸ってええかの？息を吸わせていただきますのじゃ。
Can I breathe for a bit? Can I take a breath? Allow me to catch my breath.

396
00:36:04,636 --> 00:36:08,556
許可制？許可制のじゃ。
Permission system? It's by permission.

397
00:36:17,076 --> 00:36:20,756
深呼吸をするのじゃ。深呼吸をさせていただきます。
Let me take a deep breath. Allow me to take a deep breath.

398
00:36:34,076 --> 00:36:35,496
深呼吸した。
I took a deep breath.

399
00:36:36,956 --> 00:36:40,516
息を... 息整ったのじゃ。
My breath... My breathing has settled down.

400
00:36:44,356 --> 00:36:51,336
ふー。ひーふー言わないように... ひーふー言わないように...
Whew. Trying not to gasp for air... Trying not to huff and puff...

401
00:36:51,336 --> 00:36:57,336
うわ、なんか曲順考えるとき、次おとなしい曲持ってきたりとかの配慮をするべきだったな。
Wow, when thinking about the setlist, I should've considered putting a calmer song next.

402
00:36:57,816 --> 00:37:00,616
あんま考えて、曲順考えてこなかった。
I didn't think much about the song order.

403
00:37:00,876 --> 00:37:04,036
次、何歌う予定なんじゃったっけ？
What was I planning to sing next again?

404
00:37:04,476 --> 00:37:08,556
あ、次から、てかゆったりな曲が一曲もない！
Ah! Starting next... Wait, there isn't a single slow song!

405
00:37:09,096 --> 00:37:12,476
ゆったりな曲が何一曲もない！
There isn't even one slow song!

406
00:37:12,936 --> 00:37:17,996
こっそり今歌う曲リストを見た件じゃけど... なんかゆったりな曲が一言もないな。
I secretly looked at the song list to sing... and there really isn't a single slow song.

407
00:37:18,316 --> 00:37:22,016
次、次ロックじゃな。次ロックじゃな。
Next is rock, right? Next is rock.

408
00:37:22,376 --> 00:37:24,456
ボカロ、ボカロロック。
Vocaloid... Vocaloid rock.

409
00:37:26,916 --> 00:37:31,716
つい... ついね、後先考えず選んでしまいました。
I ended up choosing them without thinking ahead.

410
00:37:31,956 --> 00:37:36,436
「これ歌いたい！これ歌いたい！」みたいな感じで選んだ結果、
As a result of picking songs like "I wanna sing this! I wanna sing this!"

411
00:37:37,356 --> 00:37:39,756
ドパ満出しすぎますのじゃ。
I'm pumping out way too much dopamine!

412
00:37:40,976 --> 00:37:44,016
よし！いくか！
Alright! Let's go!

413
00:37:45,556 --> 00:37:48,196
のじゃー！
Noja-!

414
00:37:51,336 --> 00:37:54,796
やっぱOmoiさん聞きたいかなと思って、おぬしら。
I thought you guys might want to hear Omoi-san.

415
00:37:55,636 --> 00:37:57,596
聞きたいかなと思って。
Thought you'd like to hear it.

416
00:38:00,916 --> 00:38:03,936
チェリーポップよりはゆっくりか。チェリーポップよりはゆっくりか。
Is it slower than Cherry Pop? Slower than Cherry Pop, maybe?

417
00:38:08,336 --> 00:38:11,676
つづら先輩歌ってた。そう、つづら先輩も「歌ってみた」出してた気がするのじゃ。
Tsuzura-senpai sang this. Yeah, I think Tsuzura-senpai released a cover of it too.

418
00:38:13,656 --> 00:38:18,236
知らないから楽しみ？素晴らしい。お楽しみにのじゃ。
"I don't know it so I'm looking forward to it"? Wonderful! Look forward to it!

419
00:38:21,016 --> 00:38:28,416
よし。バラードではないね！バラードでは間違いなくないが...
Alright. It's not a ballad! Definitely not a ballad, but...

420
00:38:28,416 --> 00:38:29,516
ないが！
But!

421
00:38:31,496 --> 00:38:38,236
よし！それでは！歌いますのじゃ！「君が飛び降りるのならば」！
Alright! Well then! I'll sing now! "If You Were to Jump"!

422
00:38:41,816 --> 00:38:47,716
あ、原曲通り咳した。
Ah, I coughed just like in the original song.

423
00:38:55,956 --> 00:38:59,656
いきなり歌い始めてごめんね ちょっとだけそのまま聞いててね
Sorry for suddenly starting to sing, please just listen like this for a bit

424
00:38:59,656 --> 00:39:03,436
本日お伝えしたいのは とっても大事な君のこと！
What I want to tell you today is about you, who's super important!

425
00:39:03,436 --> 00:39:06,896
たまには喧嘩もしてきたけど だからこそなんでも知ってんだ
We've had fights sometimes, but that's why I know everything about you

426
00:39:06,896 --> 00:39:10,556
君の長所は真面目なこと ただ妄想癖がひどい
Your strong point is being serious, but your delusion habit is terrible!

427
00:39:10,556 --> 00:39:14,516
（君が）飛び降りるのならば僕は
If you were to jump, I...

428
00:39:14,516 --> 00:39:18,576
笑って一緒に飛び降りる
...will laugh and jump down with you!

429
00:39:18,576 --> 00:39:22,376
止めてくれるとでも思ったか 僕らの絆を見くびるな！
Did you think I'd stop you? Don't underestimate our bond!

430
00:39:22,376 --> 00:39:26,336
そして手を繋いで落ちて行こう 地面めがけてピースしよう
So let's fall holding hands and strike a peace sign at the ground!

431
00:39:26,336 --> 00:39:30,116
でもそういえば何かを 忘れているような…
But come to think of it, feels like I'm forgetting something...

432
00:39:30,116 --> 00:39:33,356
（あぁそうだ！）
(Ah, that's right!)

433
00:39:33,356 --> 00:39:37,156
見たいテレビがあった！
There was a TV show I wanted to watch!

434
00:39:37,156 --> 00:39:41,036
やっぱり飛ぶの後あとにしませんか！
Can we put off the jumping until later?!

435
00:39:41,036 --> 00:39:45,236
君に出会ってからのというもの 全てとにかくおかしくなった
Ever since I met you, everything just became so crazy

436
00:39:45,236 --> 00:39:49,256
占いなんか信じてなかったのに 気付けばのめり込んでいた
I didn't believe in fortune-telling, but before I knew it, I was totally into it

437
00:39:49,256 --> 00:39:53,356
変な音楽ばかり勧めて 変な漫画ばかり押し付けて
Recommending strange music and pushing weird manga on me

438
00:39:53,356 --> 00:39:59,716
ヒトの人生左右しといて ふざけんな覚えてろこの野郎！
You influenced someone else's life like that, don't mess around, remember this, you jerk!

439
00:39:59,716 --> 00:40:01,956
（君が）飛び降りるのならば僕は
If you were to jump, I...

440
00:40:02,097 --> 00:40:04,897
君よりも先に飛び降りる
I'll jump off before you do!

441
00:40:04,897 --> 00:40:08,597
説得されるとでも思ったか？ 僕の甘さを甘く見るな！
Did you really think you could persuade me? Don't underestimate my naivety!

442
00:40:08,597 --> 00:40:11,597
え何？ あのマンガの主人公が今週敵を倒したって？
Huh, what? The main character of that manga defeated the enemy this week?

443
00:40:11,597 --> 00:40:16,397
って何回言えば分かるんだ 僕単行本派なんだ！
How many times do I have to tell you? I'm a volume reader!

444
00:40:16,397 --> 00:40:21,497
ああ次出るのいつだっけ それ読むまでは絶対許さない！
Ah, when is the next volume coming out? I won't let you die until I read it!

445
00:40:21,497 --> 00:40:28,597
はあー！
Haah!

446
00:40:32,097 --> 00:40:45,797
いつか僕らは 答え合わせするのかな そんな未来は 忘れるまで秘めたまま
I wonder if we'll check our answers someday... Keeping such a future hidden until we forget...

447
00:40:51,897 --> 00:40:55,097
さあさあレディースエンジェントルメン
Come one, come all, ladies and gentlemen!

448
00:40:55,097 --> 00:40:59,397
これよりお目にかかけますは 一世一代の大舞台
What we're about to show you is the grand stage of a lifetime!

449
00:40:59,397 --> 00:41:03,097
長くてもどうぞごゆっくり
Even if it takes a long time, please sit back and enjoy!

450
00:41:03,097 --> 00:41:08,597
君が飛び降りるのならば僕は 笑って一緒に飛び降りる
If you jump off, I'll jump off with you with a smile!

451
00:41:08,597 --> 00:41:12,597
止めてくれるとでも思ったか？ 僕らの絆を見くびるな！
Did you think I'd stop you? Don't underestimate our bond!

452
00:41:12,597 --> 00:41:17,597
次に僕らが出会う世界でも またこんな風になれたらいいね
Even in the next world where we meet, I hope we can be like this again.

453
00:41:17,597 --> 00:41:25,597
生まれ変わったら何になるか 本で占ってみようか 君は「玉ねぎ」僕は「タイヤ」
Shall we predict with a book what we'll become when reborn? You're an "onion", I'm a "tire".

454
00:41:25,597 --> 00:41:29,597
やっぱり飛ぶの今度にしませんか...？
Maybe... shall we postpone jumping to another time...?

455
00:41:29,597 --> 00:41:40,297
ホントのホントに飛べる日目指して もうちょっとだけ一緒にいませんか
Aiming for the day we can truly, really fly, why don't we stay together just a little longer?

456
00:41:45,097 --> 00:41:47,397
のじゃー！
Noja~!

457
00:41:48,097 --> 00:41:54,597
汗書いてきた。汗かいてきた、熱くなってきた。今日めっちゃ寒かったの。
I'm breaking a sweat. I'm sweating, getting warm. It was super cold today though.

458
00:41:57,597 --> 00:42:04,597
今日めっちゃ、寒すぎてサムムになったってツイートするか悩んだくらい寒かったの。
It was so cold today that I almost tweeted that it was so cold I became a "Samumu".

459
00:42:06,597 --> 00:42:14,597
のじゃー！『君が飛び降りるのならば』を歌いましたのじゃー！
Noja~! That was "Kimi ga Tobioriru no Naraba" noja~!

460
00:42:16,397 --> 00:42:20,897
うん、寒すぎてサムムになりましたのじゃ。エアコンはちなみに点けておりますのじゃ。
Yeah, it was so cold I became Samumu. By the way, I have the air conditioner turned on noja.

461
00:42:26,097 --> 00:42:28,597
ふうー...
Phew...

462
00:42:29,297 --> 00:42:32,897
ちょっと息を静めてもいいかの？
Can I catch my breath for a second?

463
00:42:36,097 --> 00:42:42,897
なんかバラード枠持ってくればよかった。息を...息を落ち着かせる...
I should've brought a ballad song next. To calm... calm my breath...

464
00:42:43,597 --> 00:42:47,397
ゾーン持ってくればよかった。
I should've brought a zone drink...

465
00:42:49,397 --> 00:42:54,897
のじゃ、今日雪降った地域もある。冬なのじゃ、もう。
Noja, there are areas where it snowed today. It's already winter.

466
00:42:57,097 --> 00:43:02,897
のじゃ... ふうー...
Noja... Phew...

467
00:43:04,597 --> 00:43:09,597
ふうー... ふうー...
Phew... Phew...

468
00:43:12,597 --> 00:43:15,297
ふうー...
Phew...

469
00:43:17,897 --> 00:43:23,097
ん？ アドリブで入れてもいい？ あのね、おぬしらにね、わしのセットリストの秘密を教えてあげるね。
Hmm? Can I improvise it? You know what, I'll tell you all the secret behind my setlist.

470
00:43:23,597 --> 00:43:26,597
この、ここにセットリスト書いてあるじゃろ？
Look, I have the setlist written right here, right?

471
00:43:26,897 --> 00:43:41,097
あの、分かる人には分かると思うんじゃけど、これをね、実はね、わし透過PNGで用意してて。これテキストファイルじゃなくて、テキストファイルを透過PNGにしたものを読み込んでいて、それをトリミングしてちょっとずつ映すみたいな感じで配信乗せてるのじゃ。
I think those who know will get it, but actually, I prepared this as a transparent PNG. This isn't a text file, I'm loading a text file converted into a transparent PNG, and trimming it to reveal a little bit at a time on stream noja.

472
00:43:42,097 --> 00:43:48,097
つまり、何が言いたいかっていうと、あの、こことここの間に曲入れようみたいな感じで改変できないのじゃ。
In other words, what I'm trying to say is that I can't just modify it on the fly like, "Let's insert a song between this and that" noja.

473
00:43:48,597 --> 00:43:51,097
統合されてる画像ファイルなのじゃ、これ。
Because this is a merged image file!

474
00:43:53,597 --> 00:43:55,597
PNGですしなのじゃ。
It's a PNG file noja.

475
00:43:58,597 --> 00:44:04,097
PNGだから、飛び入りはね、無理なのじゃ。
So since it's a PNG, adding something last minute is impossible noja!

476
00:44:04,597 --> 00:44:10,097
そうなのじゃ。決められた...決められた道... 前ちょっと透けちゃってたことありましたね。そう！
That's right. A fixed... a fixed path... Before, there was a time where it accidentally leaked through transparently, right? Exactly!

477
00:44:10,597 --> 00:44:17,597
そう、だから、ちょっとトリミングをね、こう、出しすぎちゃうと見えちゃうみたいな。見えすぎちゃうみたいな。
Right, so if I trim it too much, it shows through, like it shows too much.

478
00:44:21,597 --> 00:44:29,597
ピーエヌジー読み方争いある？ え、わしPNG派。PNGだけどジェイペグっていう、統一されてないのじゃ。
Is there a debate on how to pronounce PNG? Oh, I'm team P-N-G. Saying "P-N-G" but calling JPEG "JPEG", it's not consistent noja.

479
00:44:32,897 --> 00:44:36,097
いける、落ち着いてきた。落ち着いてきたのじゃ。
Okay, I'm good. I've calmed down. I've calmed down noja.

480
00:44:36,297 --> 00:44:46,097
あのね、なんでこんなに、あの、雑談をそんな挟まずに歌おうとするかを説明させてほしい。わし歌枠は...
You know, let me explain why I try to sing without sandwiching too much chat in between. For me, singing streams are...

481
00:44:46,297 --> 00:44:54,097
歌だけ聞きたい派。歌か、もしくは歌にまつわる雑談を聞きたい派。歌枠はなんかできるだけ歌聞きたい派なのじゃ。
I'm in the group that just wants to hear songs. Or chat related to the songs. During singing streams, I want to listen to songs as much as possible noja.

482
00:44:55,297 --> 00:45:01,897
ピーエヌジー派多い。そう、ドパ、ドパはッパじゃから。そう、自分のために。
Lots of people say P-N-G. Yeah, DOPA... DOPA is "-ppa". Yeah, for myself.

483
00:45:02,105 --> 00:45:05,505
自分のために次の曲歌いたい気持ちあり。
I kind of feel like singing the next song for myself.

484
00:45:07,305 --> 00:45:11,605
レイペクトPNGじゃ違う？ 知ってますよ、もちろん。もちろん、もちろん分かっておりますのじゃ。
"Raypect PNG"? No, that's not it! I know, of course. Of course I know.

485
00:45:11,705 --> 00:45:15,305
なんたってわしはあちちめら先生じゃからね。
After all, I am Mela-sensei!

486
00:45:15,705 --> 00:45:23,905
おぬしらが使っているメンバーシップスタンプ、今日急遽搭載された標識のスタンプ、こちらわしが配信前に急いで描いたスタンプですのじゃ。
The membership stamp you guys are using, the sign stamp urgently added today, was drawn by me in a hurry before the stream!

487
00:45:27,305 --> 00:45:34,905
そうですのじゃ。あの、歌枠までに標識追加したいなーって思ってたんじゃけど、もうすっかり忘れてて。
That's right. I was thinking of adding the sign stamp before the singing stream, but I completely forgot...

488
00:45:35,305 --> 00:45:41,205
「やべっ」って配信前に思い出して、しゃしゃしゃって書いたのじゃ。
Then right before the stream, I remembered, "Oh crap!" and quickly drew it.

489
00:45:41,905 --> 00:45:46,305
「あちちめらさんの発注はいつも急ですのじゃ」ってあちちめら先生に言われたのじゃ。
"Achichi Mela-san's orders are always so sudden," Mela-sensei complained to me!

490
00:45:47,405 --> 00:45:50,405
よいしょ。ちょちょちょちょちょ...
All right. Wait, wait, wait, wait...

491
00:45:53,705 --> 00:45:57,805
次の曲を歌わせていただくか。
Shall I sing the next song?

492
00:45:59,205 --> 00:46:05,105
歌わせて...いただきますか。
Shall I... sing it?

493
00:46:08,705 --> 00:46:13,505
そろそろチェビオも歌わせていただきますか。
Is it about time to sing a CeVIO song too?

494
00:46:14,905 --> 00:46:23,905
よいしょ。『きゅうくらりん』を歌いますのじゃー！
Up we go. I'm going to sing "Kyu-kurarin"!

495
00:46:29,505 --> 00:46:36,305
もし分身した方がいい？ VTuberってそういうのアリ？ できるのかな？
Should I split myself into copies? Is that allowed for VTubers? Can I even do that?

496
00:46:37,405 --> 00:46:40,305
もし増えられるのかな？
I wonder if I can multiply?

497
00:46:44,305 --> 00:46:48,105
わし、わし分身した方がいい？ もしかしてわし...
Should I split myself? Could it be that I...

498
00:46:49,405 --> 00:46:59,105
『きゅうくらりん』のために分身した方が良かったりする？ もしかして...もしかして...
...should split myself for "Kyu-kurarin"? Could it be...? Could it be...?

499
00:47:03,905 --> 00:47:06,605
分身した方が良かったりする？
Is it better if I split myself?

500
00:47:06,905 --> 00:47:10,605
ちょっと...ちょっと目チカチカするか。
Is it a bit... a bit too flickering for the eyes?

501
00:47:10,605 --> 00:47:14,905
1体でいいか。1体でいいわ。ちょ、2体は多いのじゃ。
One is fine. One is enough. Wait, two is too many.

502
00:47:14,905 --> 00:47:22,305
ちょ、ちょっと何千...気持ち...気持ち...気持ち二重になってるぐらいで...
Wait, maybe just enough to look... slightly... slightly doubled...

503
00:47:25,105 --> 00:47:31,205
ちょっと3...3体だとちょっと目チカチカするか。
Three... with three, it's a bit too flashy, huh?

504
00:47:32,105 --> 00:47:36,305
じゃ、一旦あちちめらとあちちめら先生にさせていただくか。
Then, for now, let's just have Achichi Mela and Mela-sensei.

505
00:47:36,805 --> 00:47:42,105
3人欲しい？ 3人欲しい？ 本体だけでいい？
You want three? You want three of me? Is just the original okay?

506
00:47:42,105 --> 00:47:46,905
そんな悲しいこと言わないで。そんな悲しいこと言わないで。
Don't say such sad things! Don't say such sad things!

507
00:47:47,405 --> 00:47:57,805
これ今...今のわしスクショして『きゅうくらりん』判定ボットに判定してもらおうかな。わしが『きゅうくらりん』になれてるか。
Should I take a screenshot of myself right now and have the Kyu-kurarin bot judge it? To see if I look like Kyu-kurarin.

508
00:47:58,305 --> 00:47:59,705
3人欲しい？
You want three of me?

509
00:48:01,105 --> 00:48:06,905
それではおぬしらの要望にお応えして...
Well then, in response to your requests...

510
00:48:08,105 --> 00:48:19,405
透明度変えればいける！ え、透明度変えたらさ、この設定で透明度変えたらさ、わしもしかして...わしもしかして全員透明になっちゃうんじゃないって思うんじゃけど。どうなんだろう？ ちょっと待ってね。
"You can change transparency!" Wait, if I change transparency in this setting, won't everyone become transparent? What do you think? Hold on a sec.

511
00:48:21,105 --> 00:48:27,605
うん、全員透明になってしまう予感あり。そうなんだよね。
Yeah, I have a feeling everyone will become transparent. That's the thing.

512
00:48:27,605 --> 00:48:31,905
ちょっとあんまりまだね、このアプリの設定を分かってない。分かってないからね。
I don't really understand this app's settings yet. I don't get it yet.

513
00:48:31,905 --> 00:48:33,505
これは『きゅうくらりん』ですか？
Is this "Kyu-kurarin"?

514
00:48:34,505 --> 00:48:36,805
はい、これは『きゅうくらりん』ですのじゃ。
Yes, this is "Kyu-kurarin"!

515
00:48:37,405 --> 00:48:39,405
よし、『きゅうくらりん』歌うか。
Alright, shall I sing "Kyu-kurarin"?

516
00:48:43,005 --> 00:48:53,705
そう、同じのをそのままコピーしてるから、全く同じのコピーしてるから、1体が透明になったら3体とも透明になるのじゃ。三位一体あちちめらですのじゃ。
Right, because I'm just copying the exact same model... if one becomes transparent, all three become transparent! I am the Trinity Achichi Mela!

517
00:48:55,105 --> 00:49:00,105
よし。『きゅうくらりん』のレイヤーは左が下？
Alright. For Kyu-kurarin's layers, is the left one on the bottom?

518
00:49:00,205 --> 00:49:11,605
いや、まあまあまあ。なんで右にしたかと言うと、左にセトリがあるから、今回はあのコメント欄、止まっているコメント欄に犠牲になってもらおうという話ですのじゃ。
Well, well, well. The reason I put them to the right is because the setlist is on the left, so this time we'll let the paused comment section be the sacrifice.

519
00:49:13,305 --> 00:49:17,605
よし。歌うのじゃ。
Alright. Time to sing!

520
00:49:19,405 --> 00:49:21,505
きゅうくらりん！
Kyu-kurarin!

521
00:49:28,605 --> 00:49:36,705
これで手動で...手動で出そうかな、MVみたいに。手動でMVみたいに。
Maybe I should manually... manually move around like in the MV! Manually like an MV!

522
00:49:45,205 --> 00:49:52,105
うるさく鳴いた 文字盤を見てた きっときっと鏡越し 8時過ぎのにおい
I looked at the noisily ticking clock face... I'm sure, through the mirror, was the scent of past 8 o'clock.

523
00:49:52,305 --> 00:50:02,705
しらけた顔 変わってなくてよかった ピンクの植木鉢の ぐちょぐちょした...
I'm glad your pale, bored face hasn't changed. Inside the pink flowerpot, the soggy...

524
00:50:03,993 --> 00:50:07,459
なに　大きく育ったものの
What... despite growing up so big,

525
00:50:07,459 --> 00:50:10,093
結ばれたつぼみが
the tied bud...

526
00:50:10,093 --> 00:50:12,493
こんなにもおぼつかない
is so uncertain...

527
00:50:12,493 --> 00:50:14,526
ああ　化石になっちまうよ
Ah, I'll turn into a fossil!

528
00:50:14,526 --> 00:50:16,693
ああ　取り繕っていたいな
Ah, I want to keep up appearances,

529
00:50:16,693 --> 00:50:18,659
ちゃんと笑えなきゃね
I have to smile properly, right?

530
00:50:18,659 --> 00:50:20,826
大した取り柄も無いから
Since I don't have any real merits...

531
00:50:20,826 --> 00:50:22,959
空っぽが埋まらないこと
The fact that my emptiness can't be filled,

532
00:50:22,959 --> 00:50:24,926
全部バレてたらどうしよう
what if everybody finds out?

533
00:50:24,926 --> 00:50:27,026
ああ　あなたの右隣
Ah, right by your side...

534
00:50:27,026 --> 00:50:29,493
わたし　きゅうくらりん
I'm feeling so lightheaded.

535
00:50:45,126 --> 00:50:49,359
例えば今夜眠って　目覚めたときに
If, for instance, I sleep tonight and when I wake up,

536
00:50:49,359 --> 00:50:56,559
起きる理由が　ひとつも見つからない
I can't find a single reason to get up...

537
00:50:56,559 --> 00:50:58,593
朝が来たら
When morning comes,

538
00:50:58,593 --> 00:51:00,559
わたしは
what will

539
00:51:00,559 --> 00:51:03,593
どうする？
I do?

540
00:51:03,593 --> 00:51:07,659
うるさく鳴いた　文字盤を見てた
Looking at the clock face that rang so loudly,

541
00:51:07,659 --> 00:51:11,759
一歩一歩あとずさり　「また明日ね」とぽつり
stepping back step by step, muttering "See you tomorrow."

542
00:51:11,759 --> 00:51:15,793
喜びより　安堵が先に来ちゃった
Relief came before joy.

543
00:51:15,793 --> 00:51:20,459
思い出西日越し　うつる小まかなヒビが
Looking at memories through the setting sun, tiny cracks reflected...

544
00:51:20,459 --> 00:51:22,659
こんなにも恐ろしい
are so terrifying!

545
00:51:22,659 --> 00:51:25,026
ああ　あなたが知ってしまう
Ah, if you find out,

546
00:51:25,026 --> 00:51:27,126
ああ　取り繕っていたいな
Ah, I want to keep up appearances,

547
00:51:27,126 --> 00:51:29,093
ちゃんと笑えなきゃね
I have to smile properly, right?

548
00:51:29,093 --> 00:51:31,293
大切が壊れちゃうから
Because what's precious will break!

549
00:51:31,293 --> 00:51:33,393
幸せな明日を願うけど
I wish for a happy tomorrow, but...

550
00:51:33,393 --> 00:51:35,426
底なしの孤独をどうしよう
What should I do about this bottomless loneliness?

551
00:51:35,426 --> 00:51:37,393
もううめき声しか出ない
I can't even make any sound other than a groan now.

552
00:51:37,393 --> 00:51:39,793
わたし　ぎゅーくらりん
I'm feeling so dizzy...

553
00:51:56,993 --> 00:52:00,826
ああ　虹がかかっている空
Ah, a rainbow spans across the sky...

554
00:52:00,826 --> 00:52:04,059
きれいと思いたくて
I want to think it's beautiful, but...

555
00:52:04,059 --> 00:52:07,959
焦がれては逃げられないこと
Longing for it, yet unable to escape,

556
00:52:07,959 --> 00:52:09,893
みんなにはくだらないこと
something so trivial to everyone else...

557
00:52:09,893 --> 00:52:14,559
もうどうしようもないの　わたし　きゅうくらりん
There's nothing I can do anymore... I'm feeling so faint.

558
00:52:14,559 --> 00:52:19,526
そばにたぐりよせた末路
The end result I pulled close to me...

559
00:52:19,526 --> 00:52:24,093
枯れ落ちたつぼみが　こんなにも汚らしくていじらしい
The withered, fallen bud is so dirty, yet so pitiful...

560
00:52:24,093 --> 00:52:26,493
ああ　呪いになっちまうよ
Ah, it's going to turn into a curse!

561
00:52:26,493 --> 00:52:28,626
ああ　「あきらめた」って言わなくっちゃ
Ah, I have to say "I gave up"...

562
00:52:28,626 --> 00:52:30,693
頭の中で
Inside my head,

563
00:52:30,693 --> 00:52:32,759
ノイズが鳴りやまないから
because the noise won't stop ringing!

564
00:52:32,759 --> 00:52:34,926
空っぽが埋まらないこと
The fact that my emptiness can't be filled,

565
00:52:34,926 --> 00:52:36,959
全部バレてたらどうしよう
what if everybody finds out?

566
00:52:36,959 --> 00:52:38,926
ああ　あの子の言うとおり
Ah, just as that girl said,

567
00:52:38,926 --> 00:52:40,926
終わりなんだ
it's the end.

568
00:52:40,926 --> 00:52:43,059
ああ　幸せになっちまうよ
Ah, I'm going to become happy!

569
00:52:43,059 --> 00:52:44,993
ああ　失うのがつらいなんて
Ah, saying that losing it hurts...

570
00:52:44,993 --> 00:52:47,059
全部ムダになったら
If it all becomes meaningless,

571
00:52:47,059 --> 00:52:49,093
愛した罰を受けるから
I'll accept the punishment for having loved.

572
00:52:49,093 --> 00:52:51,326
ひどく優しいあなたの
So terribly kind, on your

573
00:52:51,326 --> 00:52:53,326
胸で泣けたならどうしよう
chest, if I could cry, what would I do?

574
00:52:53,326 --> 00:52:55,359
最後見たのはそんな夢
The last thing I saw was a dream like that...

575
00:52:55,359 --> 00:52:57,993
わたし　ちゅうぶらりん
I'm left hanging in midair...

576
00:53:13,993 --> 00:53:15,759
最初の方さ
Earlier on,

577
00:53:15,759 --> 00:53:17,793
間奏でだけさ
during the instrumental breaks,

578
00:53:17,793 --> 00:53:21,326
最初の方間奏でだけさ
earlier on, only during the breaks,

579
00:53:21,326 --> 00:53:23,459
増やしてたんじゃけどさ
I was adding more of myself...

580
00:53:23,459 --> 00:53:26,059
どうしてもサビのさ
but I just couldn't resist doing it during the chorus,

581
00:53:26,059 --> 00:53:31,226
「化石になっちまうよ」のところでさ、音合わせしてさ
right at "I'll turn into a fossil!", timing it to the music...

582
00:53:31,226 --> 00:53:33,793
増やしたくてさ
I wanted to add more clones...

583
00:53:33,793 --> 00:53:35,726
増やしたくてね
I really wanted to, you know?

584
00:53:36,393 --> 00:53:38,893
あの、頑張ってた、歌いながら。
Um, I was trying hard while singing.

585
00:53:38,893 --> 00:53:44,493
歌いながら、こう、レイヤーを一個ずつ表示するボタンをポチポチ...
While singing, I was clicking the buttons to reveal each layer one by one...

586
00:53:44,793 --> 00:53:48,793
ポチポチをしてた！
I was clicking away!

587
00:53:50,793 --> 00:53:52,993
手動にしてたのじゃ。
I was doing it manually.

588
00:53:53,893 --> 00:53:55,293
残念だな。
That's a shame.

589
00:53:55,293 --> 00:53:59,293
歌枠の歌唱部分の切り抜きは禁止じゃから、
Clips of the singing parts from karaoke streams are forbidden,

590
00:53:59,293 --> 00:54:02,293
ここ切り抜いてもらえないの悲しいのじゃ。
so it's sad that nobody can clip this part.

591
00:54:02,493 --> 00:54:06,493
あの、音なしで歌詞を隠して、
Um, without audio and with the lyrics hidden,

592
00:54:06,493 --> 00:54:09,993
音なしで歌詞を隠して、
without audio and with the lyrics hidden,

593
00:54:09,993 --> 00:54:13,493
切り抜けば権利的には問題ないのじゃ。
if you clip it, there shouldn't be any copyright issues.

594
00:54:13,493 --> 00:54:15,993
メロディーと歌詞がダメなのじゃ。
It's the melody and lyrics that are restricted.

595
00:54:15,993 --> 00:54:17,493
歌詞を隠して、
Hide the lyrics,

596
00:54:18,793 --> 00:54:20,793
音を消して、
mute the sound,

597
00:54:21,993 --> 00:54:23,393
見て。
and watch it!

598
00:54:30,493 --> 00:54:33,493
すごい頑張った、すごい頑張った、わし。
I worked really hard, I really did!

599
00:54:33,493 --> 00:54:35,893
こう、ポチポチポチポチポチッて。
Like, click-click-click-click-click!

600
00:54:35,893 --> 00:54:37,993
しかも歌いながらじゃよ！歌いながら！
And while singing, no less! While singing!

601
00:54:37,993 --> 00:54:39,293
歌いながらさ、
While singing...

602
00:54:39,993 --> 00:54:41,693
頑張ってさ。
I tried my best.

603
00:54:41,693 --> 00:54:44,493
しかもさ、「きゅうくらりん」ってボカロ曲ってむずいじゃろ？
And besides, Vocaloid songs like "Kyu-Kurarin" are hard, right?

604
00:54:44,493 --> 00:54:48,593
難しいのにさ、こう頑張ってさ、むずいと思いながらさ、ポチポチポチポチポチポチッて！
Even though it's hard, I tried my best, thinking how tough it was, while clicking away like click-click-click-click!

605
00:54:48,593 --> 00:54:52,293
で、しかもさ、そのポチポチ増やしてるのが自分でおもしろすぎてさ、やってて。
And on top of that, clicking to add more of myself was just way too funny to me while doing it!

606
00:54:53,793 --> 00:54:55,993
自分でさ、手動でさ、
Doing it myself, manually...

607
00:54:56,993 --> 00:55:00,993
手動で「きゅうくらりん」やってるのがおもしろすぎてさ！
Doing "Kyu-Kurarin" manually was just so funny!

608
00:55:00,993 --> 00:55:02,493
ずっと笑いそうに...
I was almost laughing the whole time...

609
00:55:07,034 --> 00:55:08,334
のじゃ…
Oh dear...

610
00:55:10,634 --> 00:55:12,034
頑張った。
I worked hard on that.

611
00:55:12,834 --> 00:55:14,434
天才かも、わし。
Maybe I'm a genius.

612
00:55:15,934 --> 00:55:17,434
天才かも。
Maybe a genius.

613
00:55:18,934 --> 00:55:20,834
ガチシュール… ガチシュールじゃった。
That was so surreal... Truly surreal.

614
00:55:20,934 --> 00:55:22,434
ガチでシュール。
Really surreal.

615
00:55:23,934 --> 00:55:25,834
よし、次の曲。
Alright, next song.

616
00:55:30,634 --> 00:55:34,534
やはり、おぬしらピノキオピーさんも聞きたいかなと思って。
I thought you guys would want to hear PinocchioP too.

617
00:55:37,034 --> 00:55:40,434
ピノキオピーさんの曲も聞き出じゃろ？
You want to hear a PinocchioP song, right?

618
00:55:44,634 --> 00:55:47,434
と思って歌っちゃおうかなーと思うのじゃ。
So I think I'm gonna sing one!

619
00:55:51,134 --> 00:55:56,134
ふー、ちょっと笑ってしまったの息整えて… 笑ってしまった息整えて…
Phew, let me catch my breath after laughing so much... Catching my breath...

620
00:55:58,934 --> 00:56:03,434
ガチで、ど… どか笑い… ど笑いしちゃった… ど笑いしてしまいましたのじゃ。
Seriously, I... I cracked up... I started laughing so hard... I completely lost it.

621
00:56:06,934 --> 00:56:08,934
そう、ピノキオピーさん。
Yeah, PinocchioP.

622
00:56:10,834 --> 00:56:13,834
ど、どどど… どどどど… どか笑い。
L-L-L... L-L-L-L... Laughing like crazy.

623
00:56:20,634 --> 00:56:22,634
ツボっちゃったのじゃ。
I just couldn't help laughing.

624
00:56:25,134 --> 00:56:29,134
よし… 行くか。
Alright... Here we go.

625
00:56:30,934 --> 00:56:33,134
いけるかな。
Can I do this?

626
00:56:33,834 --> 00:56:37,134
どっぱ笑い… どっぱ笑いしちゃったのじゃ。
Bursting out... I bursted out laughing so hard.

627
00:56:37,634 --> 00:56:40,434
よし… 行くか。
Alright... Here we go.

628
00:56:42,434 --> 00:56:49,634
[Title: 転生林檎 / 作詞・作曲 ピノキオピー]
[Title: Reincarnation Apple / Lyrics & Composition: PinocchioP]

629
00:56:54,634 --> 00:56:58,334
平凡な自分が嫌 なんでもない生活が嫌
I hate being ordinary, I hate a mundane life

630
00:56:58,334 --> 00:57:02,134
胡散臭い売人から買った 怪しい林檎を頬張った
I munched on a shady apple I bought from a shady dealer

631
00:57:02,134 --> 00:57:08,634
賢いワナビーはみんなやってる 一端の何者かに生まれ変わって やり直せる 転生林檎
Smart wannabes are all doing it, reborn as somebody respectable, starting over with the Reincarnation Apple

632
00:57:21,134 --> 00:57:24,634
ある表現者になった 全世界で賞賛された
I became an artist, praised all across the world

633
00:57:24,634 --> 00:57:28,634
自分は特別で他は凡人で その才能に酔いしれた
I was special and everyone else was ordinary, drunk on that talent of mine

634
00:57:28,634 --> 00:57:32,134
だが人を愛する才能はなく 愛する仲間は去っていった
But I had no talent for loving people, and my loved companions all left

635
00:57:32,134 --> 00:57:34,634
あーまたダメでした 転生しよう
Ah, failed again, time to reincarnate

636
00:57:34,634 --> 00:57:38,634
ある発明家になった 世紀の大発明をした
I became an inventor, made the invention of the century

637
00:57:38,634 --> 00:57:42,134
世界の平和になりますように 本気で心から願った
Prayed sincerely from the bottom of my heart that it would bring world peace

638
00:57:42,134 --> 00:57:45,634
だが発明は兵器利用されて 残酷な血の雨が降った
But the invention was used for weapons, and a cruel rain of blood fell

639
00:57:45,634 --> 00:57:48,634
あーまたダメでした 転生しよう
Ah, failed again, time to reincarnate

640
00:57:48,634 --> 00:57:52,134
才能がないからチェンジ またリセット
No talent, so change, reset again

641
00:57:52,134 --> 00:57:55,134
頭が悪いからチェンジ またリセット
Not smart, so change, reset again

642
00:57:55,134 --> 00:57:58,634
人生の攻略法 幸福の必勝法
Strategy for life, winning formula for happiness

643
00:57:58,634 --> 00:58:02,134
見つからないね 「自分」が消えちゃったの？
Can't find it, can we? Has the "real me" vanished?

644
00:58:02,134 --> 00:58:08,634
くりかえしくりかえし生まれ変わり 山積みの死骸の上でダンシング
Reborn again and again, dancing on top of a mountain of corpses

645
00:58:08,634 --> 00:58:15,134
リインカーネーション リインカーネーションの悲痛な叫び 愛して 愛してーや
Reincarnation, reincarnation's tragic cry: "Love me, love me..."

646
00:58:15,134 --> 00:58:21,634
くりかえしくりかえし生まれ変わり きらめく似たり寄ったりのストーリー
Reborn again and again, a glittering, similar story

647
00:58:21,634 --> 00:58:28,134
リインカーネーション リインカーネーションの果てのオーバーキル どうして どうして
Reincarnation, reincarnation's overkill at the end, why, oh why?

648
00:58:28,134 --> 00:58:31,634
ある救世主になった 無償の愛を分け与えた
I became a savior, bestowing unconditional love

649
00:58:31,634 --> 00:58:35,634
たくさんの人が慕い尊敬し 老いも若きも頭下げた
Many adored and respected me, young and old bowed their heads

650
00:58:35,634 --> 00:58:38,934
だが純粋すぎて悪に騙され 骨までしゃぶられてしまった
But being too pure, I was deceived by evil and bled dry to the bone

651
00:58:38,934 --> 00:58:41,634
あーまたダメでした 転生しよう
Ah, failed again, time to reincarnate

652
00:58:41,634 --> 00:58:45,134
ある革命家になった 変な綺麗事を嫌った
I became a revolutionary, despising weird whitewashing

653
00:58:45,134 --> 00:58:48,934
正直者が馬鹿を見る世界で ルールを疑い戦った
In a world where honest people are taken for fools, I doubted rules and fought

654
00:58:48,934 --> 00:58:52,134
だが手に入れた力に溺れ 平和ごと燃やしてしまった
But drunk on the power I gained, I burned everything down along with peace

655
00:58:52,134 --> 00:58:55,134
あーまたダメでした 転生しよう
Ah, failed again, time to reincarnate

656
00:58:55,134 --> 00:58:58,634
人望がないからチェンジ またリセット
No popularity, so change, reset again

657
00:58:58,634 --> 00:59:01,934
大義がないからチェンジ またリセット
No noble cause, so change, reset again

658
00:59:01,934 --> 00:59:05,634
快楽の奴隷 インテリの亡霊
A slave to pleasure, a ghost of an intellectual

659
00:59:05,634 --> 00:59:08,934
異世界でも現実はシャバかったよ
Even in an alternate world, reality was disappointing

660
00:59:08,934 --> 00:59:15,334
くりかえしくりかえし生まれ変わり 歴史なき無教養のアイムソーリー
Reborn again and again, an uneducated "I'm sorry" with no history

661
00:59:15,334 --> 00:59:21,934
リインカーネーション リインカーネーションの悲痛な叫び 愛して 愛してーや
Reincarnation, reincarnation's tragic cry: "Love me, love me..."

662
00:59:21,934 --> 00:59:28,634
くりかえしくりかえし生まれ変わり 1000回やっても失敗のラブストーリー
Reborn again and again, a failed love story even after 1000 tries

663
00:59:28,634 --> 00:59:35,134
リインカーネーション リインカーネーションの果てのオーバーキル どうして どうして
Reincarnation, reincarnation's overkill at the end, why, oh why?

664
00:59:35,134 --> 00:59:38,634
ある冒険者になった 理想を求めて旅立った
I became an adventurer, setting off in search of ideals

665
00:59:38,634 --> 00:59:42,134
無謀な挑戦でも貫く姿勢に 人々は感動した
People were moved by my attitude of persevering through reckless challenges

666
00:59:42,134 --> 00:59:45,634
だが理想を求めるがあまり 罪のない人が犠牲になった
But pursuing ideals too far, innocent people became sacrifices

667
00:59:45,634 --> 00:59:48,634
あーあーまたダメ どこへ向かうのだろう？
Ah, ah, failed again, where am I heading?

668
00:59:48,634 --> 00:59:55,334
くりかえしくりかえし生まれ変わり 山積みの死骸の上でダンシング
Reborn again and again, dancing on top of a mountain of corpses

669
00:59:55,334 --> 01:00:02,134
リインカーネーション リインカーネーションの悲痛な叫び 愛して 愛してーや 転生林檎 転生林檎で
Reincarnation, reincarnation's tragic cry: "Love me, love me...", with the Reincarnation Apple, with the Reincarnation Apple...

670
01:00:02,812 --> 01:00:04,872
転生林檎 転生林檎で生まれ変わり
Transmigrating Apple, reborn with Transmigrating Apple...

671
01:00:04,872 --> 01:00:07,912
転生林檎 転生林檎で限界知ったり
Transmigrating Apple, knowing my limits with Transmigrating Apple...

672
01:00:07,912 --> 01:00:11,252
転生林檎 転生林檎で一巻の終わり
Transmigrating Apple, the end of the line with Transmigrating Apple...

673
01:00:11,252 --> 01:00:13,972
どうして どうして
Why, oh why...?

674
01:00:16,052 --> 01:00:19,442
ああ 転生が終わった 平凡な自分に戻った
Ah, reincarnation is over, back to being my average self.

675
01:00:19,442 --> 01:00:22,732
悲しいけどなんだかホッとした さあ自分はどうしようか
It's sad, but somehow a relief, so what should I do now?

676
01:00:22,732 --> 01:00:26,042
シラフに戻ったらみんなやめてく 自分自身であるために
Once back to reality, everyone quits, all to stay true to oneself.

677
01:00:26,042 --> 01:00:29,562
ゴミ箱に捨てた転生林檎
Threw the Transmigrating Apple into the trash.

678
01:00:35,942 --> 01:00:37,942
のじゃー！
Noja-!

679
01:00:39,442 --> 01:00:42,942
転生林檎でした！のじゃー！
That was "Tensei Ringo"! Noja-!

680
01:00:44,342 --> 01:00:46,042
かっこいいよね。
It's so cool, isn't it?

681
01:00:46,342 --> 01:00:50,542
わしさ、ラスサビのさ… ラスサビのさ…
You know, for me, the final chorus... the final chorus...

682
01:00:51,142 --> 01:00:55,042
「転生林檎で限界知ったり」のところのね
During the "knowing my limits with Transmigrating Apple" part,

683
01:00:55,142 --> 01:00:59,542
原曲の音源がね… 原曲だとね…
the original track's backing music... in the original song...

684
01:00:59,542 --> 01:01:02,742
あの、縦でバシバシ切られるの。
it gets sharply cut off on the beat, like bash-bash!

685
01:01:02,742 --> 01:01:06,342
タタッタタッタタタタってすごい めっちゃキメキメしててね
It goes ta-ta-tat-ta-ta-ta-ta, rhythmic precision,

686
01:01:06,842 --> 01:01:09,642
そこがガチかっこよくてめちゃくちゃ好きなのじゃ。
that part is seriously cool and I love it so much.

687
01:01:09,842 --> 01:01:15,342
サラマンダーはキメが大好き。 サラマンダーキメが大好きですのじゃ。
Salamanders love sharp hits! This salamander loves punchy accents.

688
01:01:17,642 --> 01:01:21,542
のじゃ。 ガチかっこいい。 うん。
Yeah. Seriously cool. Yep.

689
01:01:24,042 --> 01:01:31,742
そして、次が最後の曲になりますのじゃー！
And next will be the final song, noja-!

690
01:01:32,542 --> 01:01:35,942
めらちはキメ顔でそう言った。 はっ！
"Merachi said so with a smug look on her face." Ha!

691
01:01:37,542 --> 01:01:42,042
